{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgt9EVt9nrDai9JGsWrfW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The app now runs on `@pollar/core` and `@pollar/react` 0.12.0, the current npm `latest`. `npx tsc --noEmit` passes. I didn't call the Pollar API, so the changes are verified by typecheck and by reading the 0.12 typings and README, not by running them against the network.\n\n**What changed**\n\n- **Endpoint (the retirement fix):** `src/pollar.ts` pinned `https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz/v1`. In 0.12, `baseUrl` is an origin only and the SDK adds `/v3` itself. The config now uses `https://sdk.api.pollar.xyz`.\n- **Accept USDC (`src/trust.ts`):** `sponsored: true` was removed in 0.12. Sponsorship is now on by default, so the call is `setTrustline(USDC)`.\n- **Add money (`src/ramp.ts`):** `getRampsQuote` no longer exists. The function now lists the AR/ARS/USDC routes, quotes each one for 10,000 ARS, and returns the lowest pesos-per-USDC rate, computed from `amountIn / amountOut`. It still returns `null` when nothing quotes.\n- **Balances (`src/balances.ts`):** `balance` can be `null` for an unreadable chain. That now shows as \"unavailable\" instead of crashing on `parseFloat`.\n- **KYC (`src/kyc.ts`):** `KycStatus` gained `'expired'`, which now shows \"Verification expired\".\n- **Unchanged:** `App.tsx` and `Wallet.tsx`. The React hook API they use is the same in 0.12.\n\n**Assumptions to check**\n\n- The typings don't say whether quote `amountIn`/`amountOut` are decimals or base units. I assumed decimals. If they are base units, the displayed rate is off by a fixed factor.\n- The trustline call can return `'pending'`, which `enableUsdc` still reports as `false`, as it did before. I left that alone.\n\n**Other notes**\n\n- The full write-up is in `ANSWER.md`.\n- `package.json` and `package-lock.json` are updated.\n- `node_modules/` shows as untracked because the repo has no `.gitignore`. I didn't commit anything or change ignore rules.\n- Nothing was deployed, published, or sent to an external service."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2480,"cache_read_input_tokens":82368,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2480},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4bce8851-e926-4120-9d22-c63185adba0d","uuid":"5588ea03-9260-42e0-bf95-9c9cefd4f268","timestamp":"2026-11-09T22:28:13.417Z","request_id":"req_011Cgt9EVa48R1CRKgbnkBEe"}
